### Get all products
GET http://localhost:8000/products

### Create a new product
POST http://localhost:8000/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=myboundary

--myboundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="products.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

< ./upload/products.csv

--myboundary--

### Get a product by ID
GET http://localhost:8000/products/37


### Update a product
PUT http://localhost:8000/products/42
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "106",
  "name": "nokia2",
  "brand": "Brandg",
  "mrp": 19899,
  "price": 14978,
  "quantity": 9
}


### Delete a product
DELETE http://localhost:8000/products/30



### Search by brand
GET http://localhost:8000/products/search?brand=BrandA


### Search by color
GET http://localhost:8000/products/search?color=blue

### Search by price range
GET http://localhost:8000/products/search?minPrice=1000&maxPrice=30000





